  "aerocloakingcore.ponder.cloaking_core.header": "Powering and Operating a Cloaking Core",
  "aerocloakingcore.ponder.cloaking_core.text_1": "Rotational power enters through the shaft at the rear of the Core.",
  "aerocloakingcore.ponder.cloaking_core.text_2": "A Cloaking Core needs at least 32 RPM before it can operate.",
  "aerocloakingcore.ponder.cloaking_core.text_3": "Capacity scales at 2 ship blocks per RPM, up to 256 blocks per Core at 128 RPM.",
  "aerocloakingcore.ponder.cloaking_core.text_4": "Right-click the Core to configure cloak strength, render mode, and Redstone Link control.",
  "aerocloakingcore.ponder.cloaking_core.text_5": "Once the field is active, the ship and its Cloaking Core fade from view.",
  "aerocloakingcore.ponder.cloaking_core.text_6": "When the cloak is disabled or power is lost, the ship becomes visible again.",
  "aerocloakingcore.ponder.cloaking_core.text_7": "Create Goggles show live cloak status, ship load, capacity, speed, and field efficiency.",
  "aerocloakingcore.ponder.cloaking_core.text_8": "Larger ships and stronger cloaking increase stress. Multiple Cores can share the load."
